{
  "description": "The rich_ui_stamp group (CONTRACT §9.17). `describe` holds answers declaring the group, one without it, and one declaring it without session.head (refused group_incomplete). `valid_stamps` and `refused_stamps` pin the stamp's wire form exactly as tool-provider/v1's rich-ui-stamp.json does: a refusal names `rich_ui.<field>`. `display_rows`, `run_started`, `heads` and `read_entries` are stamped and unstamped shapes that round-trip; an unstamped shape carries no `rich_ui` member, so its bytes are those of a runner without the group. `read_requests` pins the opt-in: `include_rich_ui: true` round-trips, `false` decodes and encodes as absence. `inconsistent_heads` are heads lineage_consistent refuses. `plans` pin the stamp a run's plan carries from its fetched system-text answers, and the plan_stale refusal of two different stamps.",
